Data Content: 82 14 68 EB D8 5F 37 BA AB C6 FC 4C 63 39 7B DF 4A B6 22 96 53 FB 82 2D 7D A7 2F 88 D4 24 C7 18
# Block Security Status: 01 = locked, 00 = not locked
